{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達創始人黃仁勳辭職，讓英偉達的股東陣營出現新變化。英偉達股東原告方延長了聯邦證券集體訴訟案的訴訟期，而部分大股東則希望黃仁勳保留回歸的可能。當地時間11月12日，英偉達披露，董事會已接受黃仁勳辭去總裁、CEO（行政總裁）和董事職務的申請，財務總監科萊特·克雷斯出任臨時CEO，哈維·瓊斯成為公司首位董事長。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586630.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:57:19.771254+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:41.952134+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:41.952134+00:00","content_hash":"268e833f0b8613ac79e5513cfe4b7a4dca04007cfd634707ff6ffb2689083433","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}